  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Promote the Adoption of Digital Technologies in Uruguay&apos;s Agriculture Sector</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Adopcin de Tecnologas Digitales en el Sector Agropecuario Uruguayo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Objetivo General del Programa es mejorar la competitividad del sector agropecuario, a travs de la profundizacin de la transformacin digital de los servicios y actividades del MGAP y el impulso a la adopcin de tecnologas digitales (AgTech), con nfasis en productores familiares y mujeres rurales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Objective of the Program is to improve the competitiveness of the agricultural sector, through the deepening of the digital transformation of MGAP services and activities and the promotion of the adoption of digital technologies (AgTech), with an emphasis on family producers and rural women.</narrative>
  </description>
